ports.com/news/2026/10/5/football-cincinnati-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-on-tnt-trutv-hbo-max</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/5/football-cincinnati-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-on-tnt-trutv-hbo-max</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVUUCGame-26" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/5/WebSizeGametimeAnnouncement-W7.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that WVU's Oct. 17 Big 12 Conference football home game against Cincinnati will be televised at noon, ET, on TNT and simulcast on TruTV and HBO Max.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/5/WebSizeGametimeAnnouncement-W7.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/5/WebSizeGametimeAnnouncement-W7.jpg"><media:title>WVUUCGame-26</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/5/WebSizeGametimeAnnouncement-W7.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:42:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59489</s:story_id></item><item><title>Lake Named Student-Athlete of the Week</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/5/rifle-lake-named-student-athlete-of-the-week</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/5/rifle-lake-named-student-athlete-of-the-week</guid><category>Rifle</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Griffin Lake aims down range during a competition" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/5/DSC07758.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Senior Griffin Lake of the West Virginia University rifle team has been named the WVU Student-Athlete of the Week, presented by University Apartments.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/5/DSC07758.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/5/DSC07758.jpg"><media:title>Griffin Lake aims down range during a competition</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/5/DSC07758.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:58:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>8</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59488</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>